es[i][0], v = edges[i][1];\n                for (int l = k; l >= 0; --l) {\n                    int weight = (l * 2 + 1) * d + c;\n                    addEdge.addEdge(u + 1 + layer * (n + 1), v + 1 + layer * (n + 1) + n, 1, weight);\n                    addEdge.addEdge(v + 1 + layer * (n + 1), u + 1 + layer * (n + 1) + n, 1, weight);\n                }\n            }\n            \n            for (int i = 1; i <= n; ++i) {\n                addEdge.addEdge(i + 1 + layer * (n + 1), i + 1 + layer * (n + 1) + n, k, c);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        int total_cost = 0;\n        while (true) {\n            int[] dist = new int[total_nodes];\n            Arrays.fill(dist, Integer.MAX_VALUE);\n            int[] prevNode = new int[total_nodes];\n            Arrays.fill(prevNode, -1);\n            int[] prevEdge = new int[total_nodes];\n            Arrays.fill(prevEdge, -1);\n            Queue<Integer> q = new LinkedList<>();\n            boolean[] inQueue = new boolean[total_nodes];\n            \n            dist[S] = 0;\n            q.offer(S);\n            inQueue[S] = true;\n            \n            while (!q.isEmpty()) {\n                int u = q.poll();\n                inQueue[u] = false;\n                \n                for (int i = 0; i < graph.get(u).size(); ++i) {\n                    Edge e = graph.get(u).get(i);\n                    if (e.capacity > 0 && dist[e.to] > dist[u] + e.cost) {\n                        dist[e.to] = dist[u] + e.cost;\n                        prevNode[e.to] = u;\n                        prevEdge[e.to] = i;\n                        if (!inQueue[e.to]) {\n                            inQueue[e.to] = true;\n                            q.offer(e.to);\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n            \n            if (dist[T] == Integer.MAX_VALUE) break;\n            \n            int flow = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n            for (int v = T; v != S; v = prevNode[v]) {\n            